eaten to pull the whole journey into an even more dangerous spiral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more the world is allowed to decay, the harder your mission becomes. Protecting your colony, preserving your sources of life, and containing corruption are all part of the same fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, every loss darkens the landscape you are trying to save. But by keeping your colony united and reclaiming the land step by step, you can turn the tide and restore the world’s vitality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034650/extras/fd0c1114b4a0cc87644d5323bc2ca6af.poster.avif?t=1788255669\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034650/extras/fd0c1114b4a0cc87644d5323bc2ca6af.webm?t=1788255669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034650/extras/fd0c1114b4a0cc87644d5323bc2ca6af.mp4?t=1788255669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034650/extras/9b4f45502321c1572bd29a6582fa3712.webp?t=1788255669\" width=730 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In solo play, BloomKeeper offers an immersive, contemplative adventure where every movement matters and your bond with the Pouics grows step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In co-op for up to 4 players, the adventure takes shape through coordination, awareness of one another, and the ability to guide the Pouics together through the unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone or with friends, each way of playing reveals a different facet of the same journey. Observe, adapt, and lead your small group to the burning rock at the heart of the disaster to breathe life back into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034650/extras/85b89c853814386cfa99693abfde5ea0.poster.avif?t=1788255669\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034650/extras/85b89c853814386cfa99693abfde5ea0.webm?t=1788255669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034650/extras/85b89c853814386cfa99693abfde5ea0.mp4?t=1788255669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034650/extras/6482430fc4fbdc68eef19fad813091cf.webp?t=1788255669\" width=730 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because the spread of the scorched zones evolves according to your progress, each run can unfold differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BloomKeeper blends exploration, guiding and managing your Pouics, real-time tactical decisions, and the joy of watching nature return little by little before your eyes. Every choice of route, protection, and regrowth changes how the land evolves, reshapes your priorities, and allows replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the regions of Hedera change their face, and your path changes with them. Bring life back to the world. Protect what can still be saved. And keep the ashes from taking it all back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Bring life back to a world in ashes by guiding the Pouics, solo or in co-op, through a real-time tactical adventure where every region you save must be protected from falling back into the embers.", "supported_languages